text.section:
To correct its articles of organization, a limited liability company shall file with the Commission articles of correction setting forth:

The name of the limited liability company;


The text of each correction;


A statement of the nature of the error necessitating each correction; and


A statement of the manner in which the correction was adopted.
				If the Commission finds that the articles of correction comply with the requirements of law and that all required fees have been paid, it shall issue a certificate of correction.
